  "description": "♥ There are 14 pages in total – each one can be printed as many times as you want.\n♥ The Pages are UNDATED so you can use this over and over again each year.\nWHAT IS INCLUDED?\n-> 1 ZIP file with 2 PDF files\n!!! 1 PDF FILE CONTAINS ALL 10 PAGES !!!\nand 1 PDF file will include a link with the editable CANVA template\n-> If you want to print only one of these pages you can simply choose which one from the printing settings. (change number of pages)\nPLEASE NOTE:\n-> Colors may vary slightly depending on the computer monitor and printer you decide to use.\n-> Print as often as you like from the comfort of your home  or send it to a local printing shop.\n-> You can upload the PDF file in Good Notes, Notability or any other planner app that can read PDF files.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>♥ There are 14 pages in total – each one can be printed as many times as you want.</p>\n<p>♥ The Pages are UNDATED so you can use this over and over again each year.</p>\n<p>WHAT IS INCLUDED?</p>\n<p>-&gt; 1 ZIP file with 2 PDF files</p>\n<p>!!! 1 PDF FILE CONTAINS ALL 10 PAGES !!!</p>\n<p>and 1 PDF file will include a link with the editable CANVA template</p>\n<p>-&gt; If you want to print only one of these pages you can simply choose which one from the printing settings. (change number of pages)</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE:</p>\n<p>-&gt; Colors may vary slightly depending on the computer monitor and printer you decide to use.<br>\n-&gt; Print as often as you like from the comfort of your home  or send it to a local printing shop.<br>\n-&gt; You can upload the PDF file in Good Notes, Notability or any other planner app that can read PDF files.</p>",
